# Track curve 0: a 30 degree arc of wooden toy railway on a 20 m radius, 2.4 m wide and 0.3 m high (60 times life size): pine sleepers (toy_pine) and two dark
# stained rails (toy_pine_dark) 1.6 m apart. No collider (the floor carries everyone: 0.3 m is under the step height).
# The ORIGIN is the circle's centre on y = 0. The arc starts on the +z axis, at the centreline point (0, 0, 20), runs towards +x and ends at (10, 0, 17.32), 30 degrees
# on. Twelve of them at yaw steps of 30 degrees (0, 30 ... 330) about the circle centre, all at one position, make a closed ring; a sleeper sits half a pitch
# in from each end so the spacing carries over the seams.
format 1

Detail detail=0.12
    Union
        Material material=toy_pine
            Union
                Rotate rotation=(0, 0.0201, 0)
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.06, 20)
                        Box size=(0.16, 0.06, 1.2)
